  "schema:description": "This resource is about tree diversity in a protected forest in the Aburi Botanic Gardens in Ghana. The data were generated through enumeration of trees within 625 m^2 sampled plot demarcated along transects.\n\nProject: Enhancing capacity for biodiversity data mobilization and use in support of sustainable development in West Africa",
